+	<!-- custom: Additional absolute BuildUnitProb response to the same capped power-per-city deficit when current unit spending is still within the normal max + 15 allowance used by military-production gates. This complements the multiplicative catch-up for peaceful personalities whose low base BuildUnitProb would otherwise react weakly: 50 means a 30% capped deficit can add +15 BuildUnitProb points. Spending is only an affordability brake, not a target to fill, and 0 disables this extra absolute response. See KI#197.8. (GPT-5.6 Thinking) -->
