+	</Define>
 	<!-- custom: How strongly normal AI build-unit probability reduces the early "short-circuit 1" base building chance while the normal +15 military-spending allowance still permits more units. 100 means BuildUnitProb 80 reduces this gate's base odds by 80%; the inherited production-progress preference inside AI_chooseBuilding remains unchanged, and 0 restores the Base AdvCiv/K-Mod short-circuit 1 odds. See KI#197.7. (GPT-5.6 Thinking) -->
