 ### SAS game record log
 
-`SASGameRecord_*.log` is a separate compact game record for autoplay and AI-strength review. It gives high-level context such as initial map/landmass geography and bonus/yield context, economy, expansion, city and battle history, autoplay start/end, player appearance/elimination, run status, worked plots, unit composition including `UnitCombat` shares, diplomacy, exploration, environmental and map changes, project-victory progress, compact air/missile/nuclear posture and per-city air-base capacity, and game state, which is useful on its own and also helps an LLM interpret detailed BBAI decision traces.
